{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03516",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 4.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Hi there, the chair's free, sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.24,
      "end_seconds": 7.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.0,
      "end_seconds": 12.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.49,
      "end_seconds": 19.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Mm, so the thing is, I've got a vague tummy ache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.26,
      "end_seconds": 24.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.02,
      "end_seconds": 29.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "about... well, two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.72,
      "end_seconds": 40.86,
      "duration_seconds": 10.14,
      "text": "Tell me a a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.85,
      "end_seconds": 55.58,
      "duration_seconds": 12.73,
      "text": "It happens all the time. Moderate, I'd say. There's poor appetite for two days as well. And I've been feeling off as well, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.97,
      "end_seconds": 66.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.56,
      "end_seconds": 75.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.79,
      "end_seconds": 96.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 83, respiratory rate 14, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, temperature 37.0, pressure 112 over 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.27,
      "end_seconds": 99.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.2,
      "end_seconds": 103.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.31,
      "end_seconds": 110.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.13,
      "end_seconds": 113.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.85,
      "end_seconds": 117.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.2,
      "end_seconds": 144.59,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "your tummy is soft but tender low on the right with mild guarding, and the temperature is only a little up"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.35,
      "end_seconds": 156.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "You can sit up now. And what about vomiting, blood in the stool or high fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.15,
      "end_seconds": 159.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.96,
      "end_seconds": 164.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Did you notice any urinary symptoms?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.44,
      "end_seconds": 170.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any urinary symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.91,
      "end_seconds": 173.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "how's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.99,
      "end_seconds": 177.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.58,
      "end_seconds": 181.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.4,
      "end_seconds": 185.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.77,
      "end_seconds": 191.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.83,
      "end_seconds": 196.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.54,
      "end_seconds": 211.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.19,
      "end_seconds": 216.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for two years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.92,
      "end_seconds": 218.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Hm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.98,
      "end_seconds": 221.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "yes, asthma"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.01,
      "end_seconds": 234.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "so, yes, asthma is known to us, good to have that clear any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.02,
      "end_seconds": 237.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.45,
      "end_seconds": 241.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.92,
      "end_seconds": 246.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Lisinopril, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.76,
      "end_seconds": 250.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.03,
      "end_seconds": 256.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "It's 10 milligrams. Seretide inhaler. I take it twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.86,
      "end_seconds": 264.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Right, a a few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.09,
      "end_seconds": 281.47,
      "duration_seconds": 15.38,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.05,
      "end_seconds": 294.99,
      "duration_seconds": 12.94,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be possible appendicitis, which can look mild in older people, or it might be diverticulitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.26,
      "end_seconds": 343.1,
      "duration_seconds": 31.84,
      "text": "We should do a CT scan of the abdomen for right iliac fossa tenderness. I'm sending you for blood tests because of abdominal pain. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Even though you look fairly well, I'd like the surgeons to see you today. I'll also refer you to the surgical team. Come back straight away. Okay, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.13,
      "end_seconds": 348.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}